[{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1300","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1300.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-29574","title":"Sophos Cyberoam OS WebAdmin 远程SQL注入漏洞","description":"Sophos Cyberoam OS 的 WebAdmin 管理界面存在 SQL 注入漏洞，影响截至 2020 年 12 月 4 日的所有版本。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向 WebAdmin 发送特制构造的 SQL 查询语句，绕过身份验证并执行任意 SQL 命令，从而获取数据库中存储的敏感信息，甚至可能通过堆叠查询进一步获取服务器权限。该漏洞利用网络可达性即可触发，无需用户交互或凭据，攻击复杂度低，危害严重。 Sophos 已发布安全公告及修复补丁，建议受影响用户尽快升级至最新版本以消除风险。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-29574"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-12-11T17:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:11:27Z","remediation":"建议立即停止使用 Sophos Cyberoam OS（已停止维护 EoL/EoS）并更换为受支持的防火墙产品。如暂时无法替换，必须在防火墙层面限制 WebAdmin 管理界面仅允许受信任 IP 访问，并在边界部署 WAF 拦截 SQL 注入攻击载荷。受影响版本为 2020-12-04 及之前，若仍有后续固件请升级至最新版本。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/sophos-fixes-sql-injection-vulnerability-in-their-cyberoam-os/","https://www.cyberoam.com/ngfw.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-29574","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-29574.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bfe508b10fd666e08d016fd72fb8c9e7ad67f3a1/cves/2020/29xxx/CVE-2020-29574.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2020/29xxx/CVE-2020-29574.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-29574.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-29574.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-29574.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-29574.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-29574.rules","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-29574.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/2045bff4b424e5738e99702781803fdc8b55ff87/CVE-2020/CVE-2020-295xx/CVE-2020-29574.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1300.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0900","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0900.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-17530","title":"Apache Struts2 远程代码执行漏洞（S2-061）","description":"Apache Struts2 框架存在远程代码执行漏洞，其根本原因在于OGNL（Object-Graph Navigation Language）表达式在标签属性中对原始用户输入执行强制求值。当攻击者构造包含恶意OGNL表达式的特制HTTP请求参数时，Struts2在解析标签属性中的用户输入时会触发OGNL表达式执行，导致未经身份认证的远程攻击者可在目标服务器上执行任意操作系统命令。该漏洞影响Apache Struts 2.0.0至2.5.25所有版本，攻击条件极为宽松，无需任何认证凭据，仅需向目标应用发送特制请求即可利用。由于Struts2被广泛应用于企业级Web应用开发，此漏洞影响面极广，CVSS v3.1评分为9.8，危害等级为严重，攻击者可借此完全控制受影响服务器，造成数据泄露、服务中断等严重后果。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-17530"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-12-11T02:15:10Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:59:05Z","remediation":"建议立即升级到 Apache Struts 2.5.26 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，应检查并移除代码中对不可信用户输入使用的强制 OGNL 求值（%{...}）语法，特别是 s:textarea、s:select 等标签的属性值中基于用户输入的内容，改由服务器端参数传递，避免在标签属性中直接引用未过滤的用户输入。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://jvn.jp/en/jp/JVN43969166/index.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160721/Apache-Struts-2-Forced-Multi-OGNL-Evaluation.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2022/04/12/6","https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/WW/S2-061","https://security.netapp.com/advisory/ntap-20210115-0005/","https://www.oracle.com//security-alerts/cpujul2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuApr2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuapr2022.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2021.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpujan2022.html","https://www.oracle.com/security-alerts/cpuoct2021.html","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-17530","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-17530.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-17530.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/内含_POC_丨漏洞复现之_S2-061(CVE-2020-17530).md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-17530-st2-16-POC.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-17530：Struts2_远程代码执行漏洞复现.md","https://github.com/Threekiii/Awesome-POC/blob/0f9e22b660cb1ea12c1c3668f9128d93e08da412/中间件漏洞/Apache Struts2 S2-061 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2020-17530.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/87f298b7b08ecd30cb88adb4e6685a3f913494e2/data/by-cve/CVE-2020-17530.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/CVE-2020-17530-st2-16-POC.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/内含 POC 丨漏洞复现之 S2-061(CVE-2020-17530).md","https://github.com/Ares-X/VulWiki/blob/40e0273754a36f49a6be6a77a7a4c210a07063ed/Web安全/Apache Struts/（CVE-2020-17530）S2-061.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/CVE-2020-17530：Struts2 远程代码执行漏洞复现.md","https://github.com/ka1n4t/CVE-2020-17530","https://github.com/wuzuowei/CVE-2020-17530","https://github.com/Al1ex/CVE-2020-17530","https://github.com/fengziHK/CVE-2020-17530-strust2-061","https://github.com/uzzzval/CVE-2020-17530"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0900.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0806","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0806.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-17144","title":"Microsoft Exchange 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"Microsoft Exchange Server 存在反序列化远程代码执行漏洞（CWE-502），经过身份认证的普通用户可通过向 Exchange 服务器发送特制的恶意请求触发不安全反序列化，从而在 Exchange 控制面板（ECP）上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Microsoft Exchange Server 2010/2013/2016/2019 等多个版本，攻击者需拥有有效 Exchange 凭据但无需管理员权限，利用复杂度较低。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 12 月安全更新中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.4,"aliases":["CVE-2020-17144"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-12-10T00:15:16Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:58:45Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 12 月安全更新（KB4588742），可通过 Microsoft Update Catalog 或 Windows Server Update Services (WSUS) 获取。对于 Exchange Server 2010 SP3，需升级至 Update Rollup 31 及以上版本。如无法立即打补丁，建议限制 Exchange 服务器的网络访问权限，仅允许受信 IP 连接，并启用 Exchange 反序列化白名单机制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://msrc.microsoft.com/update-guide/vulnerability/CVE-2020-17144","https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-17144","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-17144","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-17144.md","https://github.com/MrWQ/vulnerability-paper/blob/fcbdb421b62aef6ccac59a1887d94687f4faf9d6/bugs/CVE-2020-17144-EXP_-_远程代码执行.md","https://github.com/0x783kb/Threat-Analysis-Handbook/blob/c35524f11e7cd0fdd97596792dc2883cedbfa69b/Web/2020/T1190-CVE-2020-17144-Exchange漏洞利用检测.md","https://github.com/SexyBeast233/SecBooks/blob/eca538546bd6b8eaade595fc9d79ffbecc4d842a/【公众号文章】bugs/CVE-2020-17144-EXP - 远程代码执行.md","https://github.com/DawnFlame/POChouse/blob/f5b80965c38eb4f42133f4f458650bae5cc75b98/Exchange/RCE-普通用户（CVE-2020-17144）/README.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-17144.md","https://github.com/k8gege/k8gege.github.io/blob/0562c0ddc0b76d93df268fcb4feea3f97fa3589d/p/CVE-2020-17144.html","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-17144.md","https://github.com/tzwlhack/Vulnerability/blob/4ac07f1a2be4f76e19faf572fbbba2131d2c62ea/CVE-2020-17144 Exchange2010 反序列化RCE.md","https://github.com/Al1ex/Pentest-tools/blob/d42312cc6010c462ab986d7ec2ffdccdfe7a1b0c/Exchange/CVELIST/CVE-2020-17144/CVE-2020-17114-EXP/rem.txt","https://github.com/zcgonvh/CVE-2020-17144","https://github.com/Airboi/CVE-2020-17144-EXP"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0806.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1200","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1200.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-27950","title":"Apple 多款产品 内存初始化信息泄露漏洞","description":"Apple XNU 内核中存在内存初始化漏洞，由于接收 Mach 消息时对消息 trailer 元素大小的计算存在错误，当请求无效的 trailer 元素组合时，内核会返回未初始化的内存数据，导致攻击者可以从 kalloc 内存池中泄露残留的内核数据。该漏洞影响 iOS 14.1 及更早版本、iPadOS 14.2 及更早版本、macOS Catalina 10.15.7 及更早版本、watchOS 7.1 及更早版本等多款 Apple 产品。攻击条件为攻击者需在目标设备上执行恶意应用程序，通过精心构造 Mach 消息并请求特定的 trailer 元素，即可触发该信息泄露漏洞。利用方式为攻击者首先使用带外端口描述符来填充 kalloc 大小类中的内核指针，随后释放这些内存分配并重新分配为 Mach 消息，在接收消息时触发漏洞以读取目标指针的值，通过调整消息大小可逐字节泄露内核内存地址，该漏洞曾被用于 iOS 漏洞链中配合 Safari 远程代码执行漏洞实现完整的攻陷过程。Apple 已在 iOS 14.2、iPadOS 14.2、macOS Big Sur 11.0.1、macOS Catalina 10.15.7 更新及 watchOS 7.1 等版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2020-27950"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-12-08T21:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:09:55Z","remediation":"建议立即升级至 Apple 已发布的安全更新版本：iOS 14.2、iPadOS 14.2、macOS Big Sur 11.0.1、macOS Catalina 10.15.7 Supplemental Update、Security Update 2020-006（High Sierra 与 Mojave）、watchOS 7.1、watchOS 6.2.9、watchOS 5.3.9 或 iOS 12.4.9，具体选择对应设备当前系统版本的安全更新。如设备暂不支持最新系统，应通过「设置」>「通用」>「软件更新」立即安装可用更新。若因合规或业务原因无法立即升级，可在 MDM 或配置描述文件中限制安装来源为 App Store 已知开发者，并禁用未签名 App 执行，同时启用沙盒与系统完整性保护（SIP）以降低内核内存泄露风险。对于无法打补丁的旧设备，建议评估是否通过网络访问控制限制其暴露面，避免运行来自不可信来源的应用。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161296/XNU-Kernel-Mach-Message-Trailers-Memory-Disclosure.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Dec/32","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211928","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211929","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211931","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211940","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211944","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211945","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211946","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211947","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-27950","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-27950.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-27950.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/911f59febd1bbb3aa37b38750a1867e7a514757c/2020/CVE-2020-27950/CVE-2020-27950_poc.c","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-27950.md","https://github.com/synacktiv/CVE-2020-27950/blob/8462fc0ef320f08fee5305690da29deed437b658/CVE-2020-27950_poc.c","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-27950.md","https://github.com/yhy0/CHYing-agent/blob/0d2ee81fa783caf119cde1423e390552e32561c0/knowledge/raw/ht_binary/CVE-2020-27950-mach_msg_trailer_t.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/911f59febd1bbb3aa37b38750a1867e7a514757c/2020/CVE-2020-27950/README.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-27950.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/911f59febd1bbb3aa37b38750a1867e7a514757c/2020/CVE-2020-27950/CVE-2020-27950_leak_port.c","https://github.com/synacktiv/CVE-2020-27950","https://github.com/lyonzon2/browser-crash-tool"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1200.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1198","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1198.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-27932","title":"Apple 多款产品 类型混淆漏洞","description":"tags.<value>多款 Apple 产品（包括 macOS、iOS、iPadOS 及 watchOS 等）存在类型混淆漏洞。该漏洞源于内核对对象类型处理不当，攻击者可通过改进的状态管理机制触发类型混淆，绕过内存安全保护。当用户在受影响的系统上运行恶意应用程序时，该应用可利用此漏洞在内核权限下执行任意代码，从而完全控制设备。该漏洞影响 macOS Big Sur 11.0.1 之前、macOS Catalina 10.15.7 之前、iOS 14.2 及 iPadOS 14.2 之前、watchOS 7.1 之前等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8（HIGH）。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-27932"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-12-08T21:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:09:53Z","remediation":"立即将设备升级至以下修复版本：iOS 升级至 14.2 或更高版本（iPhone 6s 及更新机型），或安装 iOS 12.4.9 安全更新（iPhone 5s 等旧机型）；iPadOS 升级至 14.2；macOS 升级至 Big Sur 11.0.1 或更高版本，Catalina 用户安装 10.15.7 Supplemental Update，High Sierra 和 Mojave 用户安装 Security Update 2020-006；watchOS 升级至 7.1（Series 3 及更新机型）或 6.2.9、5.3.9（旧机型）。所有设备建议在\"系统设置\"→\"通用\"→\"软件更新\"中开启自动更新。如无法立即更新，应避免安装来源不明的应用程序，并在防火墙中限制不必要的入站连接作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161295/XNU-Kernel-Turnstiles-Type-Confusion.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Dec/32","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211928","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211929","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211931","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211940","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211944","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211945","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211946","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211947","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-27932","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-27932.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-27932.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/20c018f1a1b9bca1242ee2249074773858b2a0ac/2020/27xxx/CVE-2020-27932.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-27932.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-27932.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-27950.md","https://github.com/BrokenPorkMachine/B34ST/blob/f4b5602a1ba3cb1d1cc6f89afe06462855e57582/exploits/kernel/CVE-2020-27932.c","https://github.com/xitu/gold-miner/blob/db4f91ae0df1f31d3b02dbf21b4137bfb9fda374/article/2021/expert-hackers-used-11-zerodays-to-infect-windows-ios-and-android-users.md","https://github.com/nailara-technologies/protocol-7/blob/355cb847bc4d33c37a7ff6bd602777a6d36f0eed/data/protocols/cisa/CVE-2020-27932","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-27932.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1198.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1168","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1168.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-27930","title":"Apple 多款产品字体处理任意代码执行漏洞","description":"Apple 多个操作系统中的字体解析组件存在内存破坏漏洞，由于对字体数据的输入验证不足，攻击者可通过诱导用户打开包含恶意构造字体的文件或网页，触发内存损坏，导致任意代码执行。该漏洞影响 macOS Big Sur 11.0.1、iOS 14.2、iPadOS 14.2、watchOS 7.1 等多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Google Project Zero 曾报告该漏洞已在野外被利用，Apple 已在 2020 年 11 月的安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-27930"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-12-08T21:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:09:53Z","remediation":"立即升级至以下修复版本：macOS Big Sur 11.0.1、iOS/iPadOS 14.2、watchOS 7.1、tvOS 14.2；旧版本用户安装 Security Update 2020-006 (High Sierra/Mojave) 或 Catalina 10.15.7 Supplemental Update。如无法升级，避免在受影响设备上打开来源不明的字体文件，并启用系统完整性保护 (SIP) 以降低利用风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161294/Apple-Safari-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://seclists.org/fulldisclosure/2020/Dec/32","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211928","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211929","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211931","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211940","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211944","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211945","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211946","https://support.apple.com/en-us/HT211947","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-27930","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-27930.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-27930.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-27930.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-27930.md","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-27930.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-27950.md","https://github.com/Ch4120N/Ch4120N-CVE-Pulse/blob/4709d2cbd3a3d8c1f80eac233d785d5a127e7498/CVEs/2020/CVE-2020-27930.md","https://github.com/xitu/gold-miner/blob/db4f91ae0df1f31d3b02dbf21b4137bfb9fda374/article/2021/expert-hackers-used-11-zerodays-to-infect-windows-ios-and-android-users.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-27932.md","https://github.com/BrokenPorkMachine/B34ST/blob/f4b5602a1ba3cb1d1cc6f89afe06462855e57582/exploits/fontparser/CVE-2020-27930.c","https://github.com/FunPhishing/Apple-Safari-Remote-Code-Execution-CVE-2020-27930"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1168.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1168.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1606","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1606.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-4006","title":"VMware Workspace ONE Access 及 Identity Manager 命令注入漏洞","description":"VMware Workspace ONE Access、Access Connector、Identity Manager 及 Identity Manager Connector 等身份管理产品组件存在命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。该漏洞位于管理配置器（Appliance Configurator）服务 8443 端口的 /cfg/ssl/installSelfSignedCertificate 端点，由于在调用后端命令执行逻辑时对用户可控的 san 参数过滤不严，攻击者可通过 POST 请求构造恶意参数将系统命令拼接执行。利用前提是能够访问配置器 8443 端口并持有 configurator admin 账户及密码，即需要高权限认证；攻击复杂度较低且无需用户交互，一旦成功即可在底层操作系统上以受影响服务权限执行任意命令，结合权限提升可能获得系统完全控制权。该漏洞波及 VMware 多个核心身份管理与单点登录组件，已被 CISA KEV 收录并证实于野利用，CVSS 评分 9.1，危害等级严重。VMware 已发布安全补丁（VMSA-2020-0027），建议立即升级受影响组件及配置器补丁并进行日志审计监控。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.1,"aliases":["CVE-2020-4006"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-11-23T22:15:12Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:19:25Z","remediation":"该漏洞位于管理配置器（Administrator Configurator）端口 8443，攻击者需拥有 configurator admin 密码方可利用。请立即按 VMware 公告 VMSA-2020-0027 修复：将 Workspace ONE Access 升级到 20.01 或 20.10 版本，将 Identity Manager（vIDM）升级到 3.3.1、3.3.2 或 3.3.3 版本，并同步对 Access Connector / vIDM Connector 应用对应补丁（见 KB81754，于 2020-12-03 VMSA-2020-0027.2 修复）。若暂无法升级，可应用 KB81731 提供的工作区缓解措施：通过防火墙/安全组限制对配置器 8443 端口的网络访问，仅允许受信任的管理网段访问，并随即将部署时设置的默认 configurator admin 密码更换为高强度随机密码，同时启用管理与命令执行日志审计、监控异常管理员登录行为。由于该漏洞已被 CISA KEV 收录并在野外利用，须优先处理。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-06T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.vmware.com/security/advisories/VMSA-2020-0027.html","https://www.kb.cert.org/vuls/id/724367","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-4006","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-4006.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/bb8fee28b4e90102956816a94f978ff2574331f4/2020/4xxx/CVE-2020-4006.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-4006.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-4006.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bd3fb132c1b8a95ef2bcf26b230a07f7c9700666/CVE/data/2020/CVE-2020-4006.json","https://github.com/tzwlhack/Vulnerability/blob/4ac07f1a2be4f76e19faf572fbbba2131d2c62ea/VMware Workspace ONE Access 命令注入漏洞（CVE-2020-4006）.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-4006.rules","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2020/CVE-2020-4006.json","https://github.com/olbat/nvdcve/blob/2aff155da1d1b98876d6e9c312b912d434f32dca/nvdcve/CVE-2020-4006.json","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2020/CVE-2020-4006.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2020/POC-AVE-2020-1606.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2020/EXP-AVE-2020-1606.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1606.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0013","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-13671","title":"Drupal Drupal Core 文件上传安全漏洞","description":"Drupal 核心在处理上传文件时未对文件名进行充分过滤和转义，导致攻击者可通过上传包含特殊扩展名的文件绕过 MIME 类型检查，使文件被服务器错误解析为 PHP 脚本执行。该漏洞影响 Drupal Core 7.x 至 9.x 多个版本分支，攻击者需拥有上传文件的权限（如管理员或特定角色），利用方式简单且危害严重，可导致远程代码执行、网站被完全控制。Drupal 官方已在 7.74、8.8.11、8.9.9 及 9.0.8 版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-13671"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-11-20T16:15:15Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:53:32Z","remediation":"升级 Drupal Core 至安全版本：7.x 升级到 7.74 及以上，8.8.x 升级到 8.8.11 及以上，8.9.x 升级到 8.9.9 及以上，9.0.x 升级到 9.0.8 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在服务器配置中禁用 PHP 执行权限的上传目录（如 `sites/default/files`），并配置 Web 服务器（Apache/Nginx）禁止解析上传目录中的 PHP 文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/5KSFM672XW3X6BR7TVKRD63SLZGKK437/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/KWM4CTMEGAC4I2CHYNJVSROY4CVXVEUT/","https://www.drupal.org/sa-core-2020-012","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-13671","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-13671.md","https://github.com/0xMarcio/cve/blob/7b5ce0c8ddaaec75eae1da91b247176dbec670ba/2020/CVE-2020-13671.md","https://github.com/FriendsOfPHP/security-advisories/blob/a92216a885598e572bf46404cf74e34e648e4507/drupal/core/CVE-2020-13671.yaml","https://github.com/FriendsOfPHP/security-advisories/blob/a92216a885598e572bf46404cf74e34e648e4507/drupal/drupal/CVE-2020-13671.yaml","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/160b2769d023cca3bba96db1842bf8222b2e286a/cves/2020/13xxx/CVE-2020-13671.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2020/13xxx/CVE-2020-13671.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-13671.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-13671.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7d01bbca5f964bd983cd04a1a88d27be22835eea/vex/cve/2020/CVE-2020-13671.json","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2020/CVE-2020-13671.rules"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-1208","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-1208.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-28949","title":"PHP PEAR Archive_Tar 任意文件覆盖漏洞","description":"PEAR Archive_Tar 组件在 1.4.10 及更早版本中存在路径遍历与文件覆盖漏洞。该组件仅对 phar 协议的 :// 文件名格式执行了清理过滤，未对其他 PHP 流包装器（如 file://）进行同等的合法性校验。未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过构造包含 file:// 协议的恶意 TAR 文件名，覆盖目标系统上的任意文件。该漏洞影响所有使用受影响版本 Archive_Tar 处理用户上传或外部来源归档文件的 PHP 应用程序，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-28949"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-11-19T19:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T03:10:53Z","remediation":"建议升级 Pear Archive_Tar 库到 1.4.11 或更高版本，该版本修复了 stream-wrapper 攻击的路径穿越漏洞；如果无法立即更新，可通过设置 allow_url_fopen=false 禁用 file:// 等不安全流类型作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/161095/PEAR-Archive_Tar-Arbitrary-File-Write.html","https://github.com/pear/Archive_Tar/issues/33","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2020/11/msg00045.html","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/42GPGVVFTLJYAKRI75IVB5R45NYQGEUR/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/4V35LBRM6HBCXBVCITKQ4UEBTXO2EG7B/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/5KSFM672XW3X6BR7TVKRD63SLZGKK437/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/KWM4CTMEGAC4I2CHYNJVSROY4CVXVEUT/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/NBYZSHYTIOBK6V7C4N7TP6KIKCRKLVWP/","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/VJQQYDAOWHD6RDITDRPHFW7WY6BS3V5N/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202101-23","https://www.debian.org/security/2020/dsa-4817","https://www.drupal.org/sa-core-2020-013","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-28949","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-28949.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/d8e64276ccc0390c8b8282c06f13ee665a5b9592/cves/2020/28xxx/CVE-2020-28949.json","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-28948.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/5e01c1166494caecdbc667191fbe09790056cc38/2020/28xxx/CVE-2020-28949.json","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-28949.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-28949.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/SSVC/data/2020/CVE-2020-28949.json","https://github.com/PwnAwan/CVEs/blob/967839a1f3dd2e43c3ca7af98749ae1712e69a04/2020/CVE-2020-28949.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/907bec44926228526b90431ce39613fe4cbd9e00/GHSA/data/2020/CVE-2020-28949.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/7ed81620937dbbe588ba076b06c9b1f7307f7b38/vex/cve/2020/CVE-2020-28949.json","https://github.com/0x240x23elu/CVE-2020-28948-and-CVE-2020-28949","https://github.com/JinHao-L/PoC-for-CVE-2020-28948-CVE-2020-28949"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-1208.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0800","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0800.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-17087","title":"Microsoft Windows 内核本地特权提升漏洞","description":"Windows 内核存在整数溢出漏洞（CWE-131），由于对输入数据长度校验不当导致计算缓冲区大小时发生溢出。本地攻击者可在获得低权限后通过运行特制程序触发该漏洞，在内核上下文中执行任意代码，实现权限提升至 SYSTEM 级别。该漏洞影响 Windows 10/11 及 Windows Server 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。Google Project Zero 已公开技术分析，表明该漏洞曾在野外被利用。Microsoft 已在 2020 年 11 月安全更新中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-17087"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-11-11T07:15:18Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:58:39Z","remediation":"立即安装 Microsoft 2020 年 11 月安全更新（KB4586781 或 KB4586793），通过 Windows Update 或 Microsoft Update Catalog 获取。该漏洞已被在野利用，无法立即打补丁时建议限制本地用户登录权限并启用 Windows Defender 攻击面减少（ASR）规则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-US/security-guidance/advisory/CVE-2020-17087","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-17087","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/15eaa178baaf955987a866a2c9d91dc02a2fb4aa/2020/CVE-2020-17087.md","https://github.com/googleprojectzero/0days-in-the-wild/blob/de543c9d14d06a99861d9c1266293db8b018ab19/0day-RCAs/2020/CVE-2020-17087.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2020-17087/README.md","https://github.com/Ascotbe/Kernelhub/blob/e55eb366bab445539ff16c63d3831ed4af91c92f/Windows/TestFailure/CVE-2020-17087/README_EN.md","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/A Look at CVE-2020-17087.md","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/e6513c0b48a121b576b654c0b00e8a0bc6d72f6d/2020/CVE-2020-17087.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/a80088c333d18acfc433e05d369205d159a29769/2020/17xxx/CVE-2020-17087.json","https://github.com/CrackerCat/simpread/blob/1ec36a5827997f39a7a815e20121b12f8d781497/md/CVE-2020-17087 整数溢出漏洞分析.md","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-17087.md","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-17087.md","https://github.com/vp777/Windows-Non-Paged-Pool-Overflow-Exploitation","https://github.com/TinToSer/CVE2020-17087","https://github.com/revengsh/CVE-2020-17087","https://github.com/raiden757/CVE-2020-17087","https://github.com/ykg88/OHTS_IE6052-CVE-2020-17087"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0800.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0409","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0409.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-13927","title":"Apache Airflow Experimental API 未授权访问漏洞","description":"Apache Airflow 的 Experimental API 默认配置存在认证缺失漏洞。该 API 在默认配置下允许所有 API 请求无需任何身份认证即可直接访问，远程未经认证的攻击者可利用此缺陷通过发送特制 HTTP 请求直接调用 Experimental API 接口，实现未授权访问敏感数据、执行任意 DAG 任务甚至远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 Apache Airflow 1.10.11 之前的所有版本，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。官方已在 Airflow 1.10.11 版本中将默认配置修改为拒绝所有未认证请求，用户需手动配置 `[api]auth_backend = airflow.api.auth.backend.deny_all` 以修复此漏洞。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-13927"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-11-10T16:15:11Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:53:54Z","remediation":"建议升级至 Apache Airflow 1.10.11 或更高版本（新版本默认已禁止未经认证的 Experimental API 访问）。对于已有安装，需手动修改 airflow.cfg 配置文件，在 [api] 段下设置 auth_backend = airflow.api.auth.backend.deny_all，并重启 Airflow 服务使配置生效；若业务需要开放接口，可配置为 airflow.api.auth.backend.basic_auth 并启用密码认证。此外，应在防火墙或反向代理层面仅允许可信来源访问 Experimental API（/api/experimental/）端口，并启用 TLS 加密传输，作为无法立即升级时的临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/162908/Apache-Airflow-1.10.10-Remote-Code-Execution.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/174764/Apache-Airflow-1.10.10-Remote-Code-Execution.html","https://lists.apache.org/thread.html/r23a81b247aa346ff193670be565b2b8ea4b17ddbc7a35fc099c1aadd%40%3Cdev.airflow.apache.org%3E","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2020-13927","https://www.exploit-db.com/exploits/49927","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2020/CVE-2020-13927.yaml","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/0950a261126c1029f51ef04a190f1baacd16eb08/2020/CVE-2020-13927.md","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/CVE-2020-13927.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/medium/cve-2020-13927-4518.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-13927-4516.yaml","https://github.com/ExpLangcn/NucleiTP/blob/2b7ecb9031a6eda4f272793045f29b339d8e0cce/CVES/critical/cve-2020-13927-4519.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/be53b1e1fe165098245bfbe673cd589934da7e3a/2020/13xxx/CVE-2020-13927.json","https://github.com/Ostorlab/KEV/blob/8feadeb8b7ff54359eab87941769781629146b23/nuclei/CVE-2020-13927.yaml","https://github.com/CVEDB/Poc-Git/blob/0275aeb329b0747c9a1d46160c921eae06095557/2020/CVE-2020-13927.md","https://github.com/sepehrdaddev/zap-scripts/blob/2b63b02ca79cc7f0023cdbab72c5c6c774354b07/active/CVE-2020-13927.js","https://github.com/kaismax/CVE-Poc/blob/6d8c93dabf674cea102713781cc534d577412357/2020/CVE-2020-13927.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2020/AVE-2020-0409.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2020-0777","file_name":"2020/AVE-2020-0777.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2020-16846","title":"SaltStack Salt API 命令执行漏洞","description":"SaltStack Salt 的 SSH Client Salt API 存在操作系统命令注入漏洞（CWE-78）。攻击者在启用 SSH 客户端的情况下，向 Salt API 发送特制的 HTTP 请求，即可在目标服务器上以 root 权限执行任意系统命令。该漏洞影响 SaltStack Salt 3002 及之前所有版本，无需身份认证即可远程利用，CVSS 评分 9.8，危害等级严重。攻击者可通过构造包含恶意命令的 SSH 登录请求，绕过 API 的输入过滤机制，实现远程代码执行，进而完全控制目标服务器。SaltStack 官方已在 3002 之后的版本中修复此漏洞，建议用户立即升级。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.8,"aliases":["CVE-2020-16846"],"sources":["kev"],"published":"2020-11-06T08:15:13Z","updated":"2026-06-17T02:58:07Z","remediation":"立即升级 SaltStack Salt 至 3002.1 或更高版本（官方于 2020 年 11 月 3 日发布安全补丁，禁用系统 shell 执行并增加 eauth/token 参数校验）。如无法立即升级，在 /etc/salt/master 中移除或注释 rest_cherrypy 配置项以禁用 Salt API 的 SSH 客户端功能，并在防火墙层面限制对 Salt API 端口（默认 8000/8080）的访问，仅允许可信管理节点连接。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-08-05T00:00:00Z","references":["http://lists.opensuse.org/opensuse-security-announce/2020-11/msg00029.html","http://packetstormsecurity.com/files/160039/SaltStack-Salt-REST-API-Arbitrary-Command-Execution.html","https://github.com/saltstack/salt/releases","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2020/12/msg00007.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2022/01/msg00000.html","https://lists.fedoraproject.org/archives/list/package-announce%40lists.fedoraproject.org/message/TPOGB2F6XUAIGFDTOCQDNB2VIXFXHWMA/","https://security.gentoo.org/glsa/202011-13"